# A piece pinned against its own king (i.e (preference)

Standing user preference: A piece pinned against its own king (i.e., moving it would expose the king to check) may still deliver check to the opposing king.

## Conventions
- A piece pinned against its own king (i.e., moving it would expose the king to check) may still deliver check to the opposing king.

